		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰνάκις</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nine times</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.230
			</span></i>:—usu.written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐννάκις</span></b>  in codd.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐννεάκις</span></b>  is v.l. in
